 <section id="about" class="about-section page-section"><div class="wrap"><h2 class="title">About LCANA</h2><div class="about-grid"><div class="about-card"><h3>Our purpose</h3><p>The Lowcountry Area of Narcotics Anonymous serves members and groups across the South Carolina Lowcountry. Our primary purpose is to carry the message to the addict who still suffers.</p><p class="about-note">NA is a fellowship of people who support one another in recovery. There are no dues or fees for membership.</p></div><div class="about-card"><h3>Who we serve</h3><p>LCANA supports meetings and members throughout the Lowcountry, including:</p><div class="community-list"><span>Bluffton</span><span>Hilton Head Island</span><span>Port Royal</span><span>Ridgeland</span><span>Walterboro</span><span>Surrounding communities</span></div></div></div></div></section><section id="contact" class="page-section"><div class="wrap"><h2 class="title">Contact LCANA</h2><p class="lead">Need help finding a meeting? Call the LCANA helpline at <a href="tel:8556132762"><strong>855-613-2762</strong></a>. Email <a href="mailto:info@lcana.org">info@lcana.org</a> for meeting corrections. Use Upload Event Flyer to send a phone photo to Activities for approval.</p><div class="submission-actions"><button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" data-submission="activity">Submit an Activity</button></div></div></section><footer><div class="wrap footer-grid"><div><strong>Lowcountry Area of Narcotics Anonymous</strong><div class="small">Helpline: 855-613-2762 • lcana.org</div><div class="small">Serving the South Carolina Lowcountry</div><div class="small"><a href="activities-chair.html">Activities Approval</a></div></div></div></footer>
